@startuml

title Activity Diagram: UC-03 Manage Products

|Customer|
start
:Customer selects "Products"\non the Home Page;

|System|
:Retrieve and display the\ncurrent product catalog;

|Customer|
:Select a specific product\nto view its full details;

|System|
:Display product details\n(price breakdown, size options,\ningredients, allergen info);

|Customer|
:Continue browsing the catalog\nor return to product list;

|Staff/Admin|
:Select "Manage Products"\nfrom the Admin Panel Dashboard;

|System|
:Display the Manage Products page\nwith all current products;

|Staff/Admin|
:Choose Add New Product, or select\nan existing product to edit or remove;
:Enter or update the product details\nand click Save or confirm Remove;

|System|
:Validate required fields\nand formatting;
if (Information valid\nand complete?) then (Yes)
  if (Product update conflicts\nwith an active order?) then (Yes)
    :Warn Staff/Admin\nbefore saving change;
    if (Staff/Admin\nconfirms save?) then (Yes)
      :Save the product record;
    else (No)
      :Cancel the update;
    endif
  else (No)
    :Save the product record to the database;
  endif
  :Refresh the live catalog;
  :Display confirmation message;
else (No)
  :Prompt for missing or\ncorrected fields;
  :Do not save the record;
endif
stop
@enduml
